		summary = "A **rhinoceros**, commonly abbreviated to **rhino**, is a member of any of the five [[Neontology|extant]] species (or numerous extinct species) of odd-toed ungulates (perissodactyls) in the [[Family (taxonomy)|family]] **Rhinocerotidae**. It is the only living family in the superfamily Rhinocerotoidea (whose members are also sometimes called rhinoceroses; the term **true rhinoceroses** is sometimes used for Rhinocerotidae).",
